{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Pizza Restaurant Together</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own pizza shop in a small town. Make tasty pizzas, serve hungry customers, and keep your restaurant running smoothly. Cook different recipes, take orders quickly, and upgrade your shop to make it the best in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends online. Work together to handle big crowds, or split tasks to become the fastest pizza team. Pizza Restaurant Together is a fun mix of cooking, management, and teamwork for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/dde47ecf438b4c405412814e61b6e7ab.webp?t=1760039230\" width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.poster.avif?t=1760039230\" width=618 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.webm?t=1760039230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896380/extras/527d619fc38ffc483eb4e5c4d452bee9.mp4?t=1760039230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Prepare various pizza recipes using fresh ingredients and customizable toppings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e</strong><br>\u200e\u200e\u200e\u200e<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s